#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "On MacOS:\n"
msgstr "Sur MacOS :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can set the runtime library path during compilation by "
"adding\n"
msgstr ""
"Alternativement, tu peux définir le chemin de la bibliothèque d'exécution "
"lors de la compilation en ajoutant\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"to the compiler flags.\n"
"In addition, the Python library needs to be available during dynamic linking. In Linux environments\n"
